==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be claimed from page three of the [[Helldivers Mobilize Warbond#Page 3|Helldivers Mobilize!]] [[Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|10|notext}} and 7 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

